# Tunnel-mode device accounts — the only place they are configured. Copy to
# devices.txt in this directory (gitignored), then restart Mosquitto.
# Format: deviceId|username|password, one physical node per line, LF line
# endings, a separate username and password for each node. deviceId must
# equal its unique_id on the server and DEVICE_ID in firmware config.h.
# Optional: boards with an account issued from the web UI need no line (a
# web-issued account wins over a line with the same username).
esp32-coldroom-01|esp32-coldroom-01|<DEVICE_01_PASSWORD>
esp32-coldroom-02|esp32-coldroom-02|<DEVICE_02_PASSWORD>
